{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"A trio of water-women can be seen here, heads just above the water. They appear to be chatting casually. One of them is missing a hand, and nearby a porpoise, sea turtle, and thresher shark can all be seen playing.","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:02:02.103000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865503531146543124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"A nameless elf arrives by the port and notices the talking trio with ab assortment of see creatures. He approaches curiously as he hadn't seen a sight like this before. \"Hello ladies, how are we doing?\" He greets them with a smirk.","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:12:29.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865506161502453760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"The three notice him then confer with each other before swimming over. The animals follow, though they continue to play.","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:16:42.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865507221851865108","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"Don't talk much do we?\" He follows up as he takes a seat on the shore with a respectable 15 ft distance away from the water.","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:18:12.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865507601525112862","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"All three laugh. \"No, we talk a fair amount,\" the one missing a hand says. \"we just wanted to see if there was something specific you wanted to talk to us about.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:19:32.269000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865507935862128640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"(has the nameless met any of these 3? one hangs out at sunrise port, the other at sunset)","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:19:49.376000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865508007614218260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"(i believe no)","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:20:20.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865508139897716736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"(cool cool)","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:20:33.583000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865508193030111252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"Hmmm.. I just wanted conversation really.\" He ponders to himself. \"But if you want me to ask, I have a question. Why do fey collect names?\" He asks with genuine curiosity, his mind still swarming with thoughts about his deal.","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:21:43.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865508486682247180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"(can't ask for his name anymore :p)","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:21:43.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865508488062173234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"(not until he gets a new one!)","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:28:12.808000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865510119160676352","reply_to_id":"865508488062173234","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"Well,\" the one on the left begins, \"rules in the feywild work differently. The simplest explanation is probably just because we can. And besides that, they taste good. If you could trick someone with a little bit of wordplay into giving you a delicious meal for free, wouldn't you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:30:39.419000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865510734091911188","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"You eat them?\" The elf's look shift to one of morbid curiosity. \"Interesting.\" He then realizes the fey's wording of her statement. \"You say trick with wordplay,\" his eyes become solemn and melancholic. \"What if I willingly gave mine?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:33:13.463000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865511380198883359","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"She exhales. \"I'd figured that was why you were asking. We could tell, you know. That you'd given away the whole of it.\" She sighs. \"The main difference is how it affects you. If your name had been given away on accident, you wouldn't really lose anything. But with what you did, it's going to change who you are. Probably already has, somewhat.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:42:44.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865513776336994324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"Well.. can't do anything about it.\" He gives a wistful sigh. \"I was just curious as to what you do with names \" He chuckles. \"A meal...\" With his friends not by his side, he loses the warmth that kept his bad thoughts away, and regret surges into him. \"A delicious meal...\" His eyes glisten like the sea before him.","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:44:53.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865514317364854786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"The trio look to each other, before the brightest-colored one speaks. \"It's not *just* a meal. That's the most immediate benefit, but it's not as though it's something that doesn't stick with us. I can't really tell you exactly how it gets used, but I don't want you to think it meant that little.\" She pauses. \"What act was your name a price for?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:49:16.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865515418890141706","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"The elf's face hardens in realization and wipes away his tears. He didn't give away his name for just a simple favor like what he did with the ravens. No, this time his sacrifice actually means something. He takes out his gifted silver wings and smiles. \"To see my friends again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:51:29.412000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865515976941502505","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"She smiles. \"Such a goal is worth most any price.\" She looks forlornly to her stump wrist before sticking her left hand out of the water to shake. \"Sonora.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:53:47.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865516554816061453","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"The elf offers his hand but offers no name. \"Sorry for suddenly being emotional,  I ruined you guy's fun.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:55:04.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865516877853491200","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"She shakes her head. \"No regrets over small things. brings you down too much, and not in the cool 'i get to watch you drown' way.\" She chuckles. \"This is Edriata\" (indicating the water woman with arcs of various color on her arms) \"and that's Darrie\" (indicating the one who first used the term 'delicious meal')","created_at":"2021-07-16T08:57:35.033000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865517510467780628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"The elf gives a slightly nervous chuckle at the mention of drowning. \"I would give you a name, but yeah...\" He sighs as he leans back, folds his legs, and lays his hands on his knees. \"So what are you guys doing? You looking for someone to do you a favor like what my friends are doing in Hampstead?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:00:42.658000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865518297423675442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"Sonora shakes her head. \"We don't really a-want for much. mostly just talking, catching up. We each live around one of the ports, so we meet up at the end of the day to talk. And what about you, nameless? Awfully late to be wandering.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:03:25.083000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865518978682978316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"I just wanted to walk around and clear my mind is all. I have learned that Ferrytown has a calming effect on my mind. Everything's so peaceful here.\" A memory of Seraxa telling him about the attacking redcoats surfaces. \"Until now that is...\" Anger flashes in the elf's face.","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:05:35.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865519525201838091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"Edriata grins. \"It *seems* peaceful to you. We do a lot of work to keep it that way. But then those awful bloodmarchers...\" she shivers in disgust. \"Only good thing about them is the color. And that's not even that good.\" she absentmindedly strokes her arm.","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:07:20.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865519968098189323","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"Why don't you guys fight back? You have magic right? Very powerful magic from what I've heard.\" He looks at the three before him with steel on his eyes. \"They fey combined with us, we could definitely give those red filths a run for their money.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:09:21.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865520474008322058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"We do.\" Darrie says. \"We can't really fight back directly too often, they learned pretty quickly to have most captains carry some cold iron with them, and that makes everything a heck of a lot harder.\" She sighs. \"So we do things in other ways. If you're looking for allies against the rosekillers, there's no better place than ferrytown as long as you know where to look.\" She nods to herself. \"You and anyone else who thinks the same should try and find Trapero. They're the one you want.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:14:10.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865521683867631641","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"And where will i find this Trapero?\" The elf listens raptly as this could be highly valuable information.","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:15:21.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865521984805142538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"\"That I can't tell you. He's quite well hidden from the rosekillers, which means he's well hidden from everyone else, too. If you can find his twin that'd probably be a good place to start. Everything Prosser does is strictly above board, so they'll be much easier to track down.\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:17:17.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865522470027395102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"Another name enters the conversation, but the elf with no name will keep it in mind. \"And I can just ask around for Prosser in the borough?\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:18:44.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865522835748683776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"She shrugs. \"Never had to, myself. But i imagine that'll work, aye.\" She pauses, looking a the trio of animals. \"CHUNK NO BITING!\" she shouts, before reaining her composure. \"Excuse me\"","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:20:25.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865523260363374593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852739008332431372","content":"The three water-women will be around here for another hour or so before they and the three animals go their separate ways for sleep. They will engage in light conversation with passers-by and introduce themselves. (i'm off to bed, gn!)","created_at":"2021-07-16T09:31:37.391000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865526076738109472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
